{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a blue shirt and a red book arranged in a row, with the shirt positioned to the left of the book and aligned horizontally with it. Additionally, for every yellow pizza in the image, there is a white bowl paired with it; the pizza is located below the shirt, and the pizza is positioned to the left of the bowl, with these two items also aligned horizontally.",
